                "message": "⚡ Do not start the report mode again on every redraw of a batch report\n\nsp-batch-report-open ran the mode (org-mode, its hooks, indentation,\nnumbering, table widgets) over the whole buffer each time a report was\ndrawn again, so every drop, restore or refresh paid for it.  The mode is\nnow started only when the buffer is not in it yet.  The table cells are\nalso only escaped when they need it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiAF6gJZsaMTJLEA9cM",
